OL,3,GNEWSAModern masculinity explored in
OL,4,Awrestling show
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new play is exploring themes of
OL,7,Fmodern masculinity in a bid to attract
OL,8,Fpeople "who would not normally attend
OL,9,Fthe theatre".
OL,11,FGurt Productions spent more than six
OL,12,Fmonths researching male communities at
OL,13,Ffootball and rugby games before
OL,14,Fcreating WWG GURTmania, which is set to
OL,15,Fshow at Bristol's Tobacco Factory
OL,16,FTheatre.
OL,18,FWWG GURTmania explores modern
OL,19,Fmasculinity by using independent
OL,20,Fwrestling to discuss pride,
OL,21,Fvulnerability and ego.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
