OL,3,GNEWSAModern masculinity explored in
OL,4,Awrestling show
OL,5,
OL,6,FBenj Foster, who plays Gurt Angle in
OL,7,Fthe show, said: "We wanted to reach out
OL,8,Fto people who don't normally come to
OL,9,Fthe theatre. The theatre is for
OL,10,Feveryone."
